{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0BFN1AM8YRSN9AWFQ1DMK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナンダコレ。そんなに引かないでください(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長濱です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーが炭酸水を飲んでいたので初めて買ってみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通の炭酸ジュースは飲めないのですが、味のないシュワシュワなら飲めるかもしれん!と意気込んで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか美容っぽい、とドヤ顔で買いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり飲めませんでした。炭酸は苦手です。喉が痛くなります(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃はアンバサとか大好きでたくさん飲んでたのにな～\nいつから飲めんくなったのでしょうか(´-`).｡oO("},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0BGN0Y8YFSYYBJPZF49H0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フードとったらボサボサでした。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0BHMD1MMEETJ5QVAVWTAR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログお読みいただきありがとうございました⊂((・⊥・))⊃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長濱ねる"}],"source":"archive"}